Source: https://github.com/sqlite/sqlite/tree/4012bdca5f1599d5dd3d6671112f170bfd48a26f/ext/vec1
SQLite extension headers: SQLite 3.46.1 amalgamation, https://www.sqlite.org/2024/sqlite-amalgamation-3460100.zip

The SQLite authors disclaim copyright to this code. The source files carry
their public-domain notices. No external SQLite library is bundled: Vec1 uses
the extension API of the host SQLite connection.

x86-64 builds combine the upstream SCALAR and AVX2 variants and use its runtime
CPU dispatch. ARM builds use the upstream NEON support. Yuki does not compile
or download this code on import.
